<div id="menu"></div>

<main class="page">
    <h1>Text fields</h1>
    <p class="lead">UITextField wraps an input or textarea. A delegate hears every edit and the return key.</p>

    <section class="demo">
        <h2>delegate</h2>
        <p><code>textFieldDidEndEditing</code> runs on every edit; <code>textFieldShouldReturn</code> runs on <kbd>Enter</kbd>. Placeholders are set from the controller.</p>
        <label class="field">
            <span>Name</span>
            <input id="text-fields-name" type="text">
        </label>
        <label class="field">
            <span>Email</span>
            <input id="text-fields-email" type="email">
        </label>
        <label class="field">
            <span>Notes</span>
            <textarea id="text-fields-notes" rows="3"></textarea>
        </label>
        <div class="row">
            <button id="text-fields-submit" class="button">Submit</button>
            <span id="text-fields-notes-count" class="text-fields-muted"></span>
        </div>
        <p id="text-fields-preview" class="output"></p>
    </section>

    <section class="demo">
        <h2>secureTextEntry and userInteractionEnabled</h2>
        <p>The switches flip the password's visibility and lock the name field above.</p>
        <label class="field">
            <span>Password</span>
            <input id="text-fields-password" type="password">
        </label>
        <div class="row">
            <label class="switch"><input id="text-fields-show-password" type="checkbox"> Show password</label>
            <label class="switch"><input id="text-fields-lock-name" type="checkbox"> Lock name</label>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
